6) What is Copy Operation?

- The Process of Copying the content from one variable to another is called as Copy Operation.
- Types: 

i) General Copy/ Normal Copy :
- It will Copy the variable space of one varible to another.
- SYNTAX :

dest_var = source_var

ii) Shallow Copy :
- It will copy the main memory layer of value space of one variable to another.
- SYNTAX : 

dest_var = source_var.copy()

iii) Deep Copy : 
- It will copy the entire content of value space of one variable to another.
- SYNTAX :

import copy
dest_var = copy.deepcopy(source_var)




